181,"end":5211,"target_id":"31d7ace0c4300b5b3fc7ef75b3ecdb15617062cf3630877d526f223383fe27e9","source_hash":"9f984faffebd91642f1e26e75c1ab3649e306236dd38deee54e7ee1495f626a6","text":"附录（政府组织法）<第8852号法令，2008年2月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00031","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000696-276163-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5211,"end":5343,"target_id":"9f94f91cc222886a0e638745d23229543fc5ae6bd329514525a686f2a6e915ef","source_hash":"1ca02d13fb5edf878712dfb619aa64f3827cf01b2c30f77de153b227f65b6f25","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。但是，……<省略>……，根据补充条例第六条修正的、在本法生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的法律部分，自该等法律各自的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00032","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000696-276163-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5343,"end":5360,"target_id":"de59a51db59672347baf607a5bf8ec02cd20076bbb328cb548e03f857f9f2d03","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00033","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000696-276163-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5360,"end":5433,"target_id":"8f4deed9b2eefd7d8b45b4bf8014516a8bca6a27371b7e76b21b03111fe6583a","source_hash":"b91bea472c0a0bb482556ac1465aa1eb4007be7d06e9faf44f441f23c7b23fb8","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）①至<62> 已省略\n\n  <63> 《会计相关从业人员等责任法》部分修订如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00034","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000696-276163-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5433,"end":5532,"target_id":"dfdc184d47e4cbed58152d7b8a90ae710aeaef095f64e1c22a3e226549633e64","source_hash":"cd1db2ea5265b30257b90ad93fdbaee1d2fa4007aeddcb2bddfdf5dfeec9f3b4","text":"  第 7 条中的“财政经济部长”应改为“战略财政部长”。\n\n  <64> 至 <747> 已省略\n\n  <748> 《会计相关从业人员等责任法》部分修订如下。 \n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00035","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000696-276163-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5532,"end":5592,"target_id":"75a65b22563921b1214ecfa02100d9220434ef924ed62136b756dc9113e1758d","source_hash":"1fe4999245921ea0c98fa8787026f9c248bc49da1466e45c6ca4ca7cf72c2ea4","text":"  第 7 条中的“财政经济部长”应改为“战略财政部长”。\n\n  <749> 至 <760> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00036","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000696-276163-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5592,"end":5600,"target_id":"